Two files here are other projects' code, vendored unchanged and loaded by path
(nopekit.modelio.load_path), never imported as packages.

gen_esp32part.py
  ESP-IDF's partition table tool, components/partition_table/gen_esp32part.py,
  from https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf at tag v5.5.6 (commit
  880a203ae603d08a94d06aa01e0d6761958e5e9e). sha256 of the file as vendored:
  02f6c1c5f012393d47987ee64bc50ba319a2eda48cbcec754d8cfaf780cce529
  SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2016-2025 Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD
  SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)
  fw.image_fits reads an ESP partition table with it, so the slot sizes are the
  ones ESP-IDF's own build computes.

dtlib.py
  Zephyr's devicetree parser, scripts/dts/python-devicetree/src/devicetree/dtlib.py,
  from https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr at tag v4.4.2 (commit
  dccb09599635bdff17633fa7e9dab014b91dce90). sha256 of the file as vendored:
  e4385636bde84b03453807af21ce5940f3c5c84b86daf7ffbbf1481af92f7489
  fw.sleep_wake reads a build's zephyr.dts with it. Its licence follows.

